          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "直接判断：该职业核对运输容器和物料，执行获准转运、监控、记录与交接。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "适合信号：能持续核编号、看状态、留记录，并在任何矛盾或报警时停手。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "谨慎条件：若会凭经验跳过清单或在压力下带故障继续，应先做纸面练习。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "安全试做只用四条虚构记录；是否值得进入看停手和交接能力。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
