      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.faq-block",
          "data": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "answer": "核心任务包括核对车辆或船舶与装载编号、检查容器状态、操作获准泵阀和搬运设备、监控流动、记录数量与时间并协调交接。",
                "id": "tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.faq.1",
                "question_key": "career.faq.tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.daily-work",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "本职业围绕运输容器和散装物料转运；三类采矿岗位在露天或地下采掘装载，柴油和重型设备技师诊断维修设备而非执行产品装卸。",
                "id": "tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.faq.2",
                "question_key": "career.faq.tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.role-comparison",
                "source_refs": [
                  "adj-continuous",
                  "adj-diesel",
                  "adj-heavy",
                  "adj-surface",
                  "adj-underground",
                  "onet"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "适配证据来自能否持续核对编号与状态、准确记录、承受户外和危险环境，并在任何矛盾或报警时停手。",
                "id": "tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.faq.3",
                "question_key": "career.faq.tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.fit",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "AI可辅助核对装载单字段、批次编号和记录完整性，但不能确认现场连接、接地、阀位、容量或泄漏状态。",
                "id": "tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.faq.4",
                "question_key": "career.faq.tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.ai-impact",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "人员必须对照批准指令、容器标识、现场仪表和安全状态复核；启停、切换、放行和应急处置由有权人员负责。",
                "id": "tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.faq.5",
                "question_key": "career.faq.tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.human-control",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "国家统计局2025年行业和人员类别工资材料未建立与O*NET 53-7121.00一一对应的中国全国单职业工资分布。",
                "id": "tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.faq.6",
                "question_key": "career.faq.tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.china-pay",
                "source_refs": [
                  "nbs"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "美国该精确职业2025年年薪中位数58,870美元、时薪中位数28.30美元。",
                "id": "tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.faq.7",
                "question_key": "career.faq.tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.us-pay",
                "source_refs": [
                  "wage"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "入门证据应展示装载单核对、编号匹配、容量与检查清单验证、异常分流和交接记录，不模拟真实设备操作。",
                "id": "tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.faq.8",
                "question_key": "career.faq.tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.education-path",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "课程、工牌或岗位名称不自动授予危险物料装卸、设备操作、取样、检漏、维修或应急指挥权限。",
                "id": "tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.faq.9",
                "question_key": "career.faq.tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.credentials",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "产品或目的容器不匹配、容量证明缺失、接地或阀门清单未签、泄漏或报警存在时停止纸面放行并升级。",
                "id": "tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.faq.10",
                "question_key": "career.faq.tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.risk-boundary",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "美国该精确职业2024年就业12,000人，2024至2034年预计增长3%至4%，期间年均空缺1,300个。",
                "id": "tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.faq.11",
                "question_key": "career.faq.tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.outlook-transition",
                "source_refs": [
                  "trend"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "是否值得进入应由纸面核单中的编号核对、状态判断、停手和交接能力决定。",
                "id": "tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.faq.12",
                "question_key": "career.faq.tank-car-truck-and-ship-loaders.career-worth",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
